/* A full-window "choose one of N" screen (psx::ui::ChoiceScreen).

   Sizes are in vh so the screen scales with the window height and stays legible from the 4:3
   presentation to widescreen; the panel is centred and capped in width so wide windows add margins,
   not stretched rows. Renderer constraints are the menu's: no opacity, box-shadow or filters. */

* {
	box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
	display: flex;
	width: 100%;
	height: 100%;
	background-color: transparent;
	font-family: "Fira Sans";
	font-size: 3vh;
	color: #E0DBC8;
}

/* A screen drawn OVER a picture the host composited (a selector whose entries are panels, each
   showing its own title's attract demo) must not paint a backdrop: the picture behind it is the
   content, and an opaque body would hide every panel. A screen that IS the whole picture keeps the
   backdrop — that is what ChoiceScreen builds by default, and setBackdropOpaque drives this. */
body:opaque {
	background-color: #0E0F0A;
}

panel {
	display: block;
	width: 100%;
	max-width: 120vh;
	margin: auto;
	padding: 4vh;
}

#heading {
	display: block;
	margin-bottom: 5vh;
	font-family: "Fira Sans Condensed";
	font-weight: bold;
	font-size: 6vh;
	text-transform: uppercase;
	text-align: center;
	color: #C2A42D;
}

/* A CAPTION BAND: the host composites pictures behind this screen (a title picker whose panels are
   live sessions), so the heading and the hint move into a band it names — usually the bottom of the
   selected panel — instead of the middle of the picture. The type shrinks with it: this is a label
   under a game, not a title over one. */
#panel:banded {
	max-width: none;
	padding: 0;
	margin: 0;
}

#panel:banded #heading {
	font-size: 2.4vh;
	margin-bottom: 0.6vh;
}

#panel:banded #hint {
	font-size: 1.5vh;
	margin-top: 0;
}

#list {
	display: block;
}

/* The host draws its own entries as pictures; the text list is then a duplicate of them.
   ChoiceScreen::setEntriesVisible drives this. */
#list:hidden {
	display: none;
}

entry {
	display: block;
	margin-bottom: 2.5vh;
	padding: 2.2vh 4vh;
	border: 0.4vh #4A4630;
	border-radius: 1.5vh;
	background-color: #1A1B13;
}

entry:selected {
	border-color: #C2A42D;
	background-color: #2B2813;
}

entry:disabled {
	border-color: #2A2A22;
	background-color: #14150F;
	color: #6B6858;
}

name {
	display: block;
	font-weight: bold;
	font-size: 4.6vh;
}

note {
	display: block;
	margin-top: 0.8vh;
	font-size: 2.6vh;
	color: #8F8A70;
}

entry:selected note {
	color: #C9C29A;
}

entry:disabled note {
	color: #A5694F;
}

#hint {
	display: block;
	margin-top: 5vh;
	font-size: 2.6vh;
	text-align: center;
	color: #8F8A70;
}
